 "remarks": "Welcome to this charming first floor condo nestled in a peaceful, gardenlike setting! Step inside to discover a spacious living room highlighted by warm hardwood floors throughout. The inviting eat-in kitchen includes stainless steel appliances with a gas stove top and wood cabinetry.  Down the hallway, you'll find 2 comfortable bedrooms with generous closet space and a conveniently located full bathroom.  This well-maintained complex features beautifully landscaped grounds, updated heating systems, newer roofs, and communal laundry facilities.  Ideally situated near Norwalk Hospital, I-95, Merritt Parkway, public transportation, shopping centers, and the vibrant SoNo Collection Shopping Mall. Explore numerous dining options nearby, such as Colony Grill and Jacob's Pickles. Whether you're looking for a cozy home or a great investment property, this condo offers it all.  Don't miss out schedule your viewing today!",
